## Recommended execution order

Don't paste all ten at once. Use:

```text
1 → Inspect
2 → Foundation
3 → Organize
4 → Expand
5 → Uriel layer
6 → README
7 → Testing
8 → Marketplace
9 → GitHub
10 → Release audit
```

That gives Claude a controlled build process instead of one enormous prompt that tries to invent the entire extension in a single pass.
